# Shell scripts run inside Linux Docker containers - a CRLF shebang line (e.g. from a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true) breaks exec() with a misleading
# "no such file or directory" error that looks like the file is missing, not malformed.
# See frontend/docker-entrypoint.sh's git history for the bug this fixes.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Image warm-up hooks (no extension) run by sh inside Linux containers; same CRLF hazard.
judge-service-go/environments/*/judge-warmup text eol=lf
